# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the unit tests (ASan preset).
#
# The C# scripting tests start the .NET runtime inside the test process (ADR-013). The runtime keeps its own heap
# (type loader, JIT code, GC metadata) for the life of the process, and is not shut down, so LeakSanitizer reports
# those blocks as leaks. Only allocations that start in these runtime modules are suppressed; engine leaks still fail.
leak:libcoreclr
leak:libclrjit
leak:libSystem.Native
leak:System.Private.CoreLib
leak:System.Reflection.Metadata
leak:doublemapper
